      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4325e6acd10148922c7114ac",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "从外圈飞奔而来的%horse_ta1！\\n日本的赛马娘，%a_horse1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "779bd6a00f00f141766fc827b6f49902636425f50eadc843f88fcf98b89d9ac7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6499"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74331ba3d3a9a101a0c02a5e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "对这个评价有些不满意吗？\\n人气第二是这位马娘，%a_h_pop2",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd16603b79347c245f02e76a13f94ae2f7e40c75cfa1059919cd4d760b6a8a67",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "65"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2800bab617cf1f10f043337",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "离得很远\\n在第二名的位置奔跑的是%a_horse2",
      "source_fingerprint": "1495465df363edab0421a299f3df65312b23824a43d549cfbb0c466456077b60",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "650"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c90dc656753657d6e25f7c4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "凯旋门赏就在眼前！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ad5a2bd9a39712bf97e61225438580ece88b88ca80575e15776e939a208d83",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6500"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3452655d128cb25b23782d6e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n她成功攻略了棘手的隆尚赛道\\n证明了自己的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9155a0c87b03f263c49361f134edd579ce5970982c6b3707c630f934e019094",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65d1ee2fe48d981299fdb06b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n作为凯旋门赏赛马娘赢得了交流战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76c841a544e01e99ec8e45fdea5fed199f2ccbf51a54083c235f3ce1b6d2f8e5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c8e77f5071cc6b739bebef8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n赢下了尼尔赏\\n并获得了制霸凯旋门赏的动力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4f8072d9a543b4433c822775a1f1fe5c8634ba7a2c62f62540a5f186f68ad5a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d05d00351935d7d59c1038",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n用精彩的跑法赢得了世界最高峰比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09270caa138f482c0f7e0e0dd2a89606e031337155ca5f40a4e0ab0873d92396",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6504"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15c013c11b61fd458057fb5f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "梦幻的大舞台\\n凯旋门赏的胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n这位年轻的日本挑战者最终达成了夙愿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb94f03df044acde59fb1088c8569d371f774a4fceb6a2019950db9976449ca",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0d2a9d76dccb848183561a0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n既前哨战后又以一场精彩的比赛\\n赢下了日本的夙愿凯旋门赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "451a6979ed43667a95a9874a60f75c8dcc2052560638422cda02345bd01542cd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6506"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd52c17efd2dc48ec3a78093",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n在这个秋天的首场比赛中获胜\\n意气风发地向凯旋门赏进发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c913d67059c2f208195d6930094ea7900503720539030adebb4b293e1085e9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6507"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1929931cb63b645164a0ecf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "日本选手获得优胜！　胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n成功赢得了凯旋门赏，实现了所有从业者\\n和所有粉丝的梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a96a1c49a5b1c782cba16c3b6cea8aff2330b79f85915ab6c47bc24fe4eb7bb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6508"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:179277294030e1a1cf2f43cb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n既前哨战后又以一场精彩的比赛\\n夺得凯旋门赏的荣誉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c832756ae7227ea002dd670d574f33da22009b5f962f578b0710eba9345090",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6509"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9730035e76e11e3411d5c0e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "这么大的差距真的没关系吗？\\n目前第二名是%a_horse2",
      "source_fingerprint": "60186ed0b0cf538d782b982a60ffcd7dd9bdd19a92a7426bde27b866ce76d876",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "651"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a49b8ebd68dd88716d5e46",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "连霸达成！　胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n今年在凯旋门赏这个大舞台中获胜，\\n达成了能够载入日本及世界历史的伟业！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1933b4540b31848b07bcfb0e2f484584e67c47e8957f20a898eac01f1764a910",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6510"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cd659d30ff7ce051ca214eb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是天狼星象征！\\n今年的凯旋门赏，闪耀着一等星光辉的是\\n日本的天狼星象征！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8f584063d411d9a473fdf98fc8c3ede521b1c176cd7db447368675d351f89d4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ea97a45d84dec86b4f5195e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是日本的神鹰！\\n这位翱翔于蓝天的怪鸟，获得了世界最强之称号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "558db5e358c3d5b2c827daf5dc360c550f8f64c499f5b647458742b742c0e9ea",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6512"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ba3a5ab1043a0035ae2961",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是曼城茶座！\\n她终于到达了梦之顶点\\n现在站在摩天楼的顶端，夺得了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c131ba22fedfa88bf02aee615660626abddda722b906dc66e68be4721218e02d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6513"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a823569b1e7fb22eb8471f3a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是跳舞城！\\n日本最强赛马娘制霸了世界最高舞台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87661f3e03d3de9022cbca6640173ee76ece38446fada6f17249269d97fdfdc7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6514"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd64ea91331cb5e3e66196a0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "终于梦想成真！　中山庆典获得第1！\\n她在这最重要的比赛中获胜，\\n达成了梦之凯旋门赏的制霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe7ff9e4923020638eb76eb7a1801fa763951fc02f4f7db46998b38181379176",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6515"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c67507d3a04e998a6e09102",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是黄金船！\\n这艘黄金的不沉舰承载着日本选手们的心意，\\n在世界这片大海上领头驰骋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25c9cee3c1b5959f738ac3459ce668f6642be9b768cf06f8182bd3ff2a4999cc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6516"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a425dbd1946e29dca77c5016",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "今年的凯旋门赏，胜者是里见光钻！\\n属于光钻的夙愿，属于日本的夙愿，\\n终于全部达成了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed49c799693a7c6f3c7d59049cfe1f2a23dbbc4e3a7697dbd681ee5521e52a0a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6517"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49821f8864db7b2a34430189",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "被拉开了很大的距离\\n在第二名的位置奔跑的是%a_horse2",
